            "review_title": "Review at Tulip Craft Beer Da Nang - Bia Thủ Công",
            "review_text": "Lars A\n15 contributions\n0\nGood food and beer in Da Nang\nMay 2026 • Solo\nLocated at a busy street the beer is good and the food is great. The staff is very friendly and helpful and try to help explain the food. All of them are not best in english but they try and you always get what you want. You dont have to eat with Chop sticks they get you a fork if you ask them. Dont be affraid if the tble next to you start talking to you there are almost just local peaple on this restarant. I ´m from Sweden so they think it was really nice to talk to the foreigner\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nalmost just local food the beer is from Belgium and almost just local people eating there\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 31, 2026",
